      <a class="ni" onclick="toast('Explore — coming soon')"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zM13.31 13.31L8.4 15.6L10.69 10.69L15.6 8.4z"/></svg><span>Explore</span></a>
